Subject: [PATCH 2/2] test(media): use portable Playwright-managed launchers in
 media-adoption-syntax

Independent audit of frozen 06bf498 (Meta Muse, Linux): this suite
still pinned one machine's browsers - a macOS system Chrome path and
a personal /Users/daisor/.../webkit-2359/pw_run.sh - unlike sibling
suites already converted by cc14a72 to Playwright-managed launchers.
On any other macOS machine the suite cannot start its browsers;
AGENTS.md section 7 forbids personal absolute paths in shared tests.
Mirror cc14a72 exactly: default Playwright-managed Chromium/WebKit.
No assertion, fixture or behavioral change.
